  "body": "Once https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/pull/1329 is merged, Fetching would return a \"controller\". To make use of that controller, the following action items need to be resolved:\r\n\r\n- [x] HTML: Use the controller in the HTML & other specs for aborting/terminating: https://github.com/whatwg/xhr/pull/346\r\n- [x] Fetch: Add `finalize` to the controller, to replace the current `finalize and report timing`. https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/pull/1413\r\n- [ ] HTML (& CSS?): Refactor callers of `finalize and report timing` to use the new fetch controller's `finalize`\r\n- [ ] WPT: Add tests that emphasizes that a resource timing entry is per-fetch and not per-response",
